cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or data, please cite the study."
title: "Contextual Cue Susceptibility in Clinical AI: A Randomized Clinician-Comparator Study"
abstract: >-
  Code and data for a paired-vignette study comparing how a single added clinical detail changes the
  diagnoses chosen by 22 large language models, 47 clinician participants and eight clinical adjudicators, with an
  irrelevant-control experiment in three frontier models.
